 R←Test_SendEmail_02(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;parms;rc;msg;log;text;lines
⍝ Send an email with APL characters in both body and subject
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 parms←∆NewMail'Subject from APL Team SMTP: ',(⊃⎕SI),'; {⍵/⍨2=+⌿0=⍵∘.|⍵}'
 parms.Body←'APL characters: Prim←{⍵/⍨2=+⌿0=⍵∘.|⍵}'
 (rc msg log text)←∆Send parms
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf parms.Subject≡∆DecodeWords text ∆Header'Subject'
 lines←{'UTF-8'⎕UCS ⎕UCS ⍵}¨SMTP.Message.SplitLines text
 →T.PassesIf(⊂⊃parms.Body)∊lines

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
